    {
      "source": "Kurohiko",
      "url": "https://hok.kurohiko.id/",
      "field": "tactical_tips",
      "content": "1) Control Lapulapu itu skill shot, hindarin tinggal gerak. 2) Pas teamfight jangan abisin skill ke tank tebel ini. 3) Pas ult-nya ready jangan ngejar dia, balasan ult-nya gampang banget kena."
    },
    {
      "source": "HoKStats",
      "url": "https://hokstats.gg/heroes/lapulapu/",
      "field": "guide",
      "content": {
        "skills": [
          {
            "name": "Sea Beast's Favor",
            "description": "Increases the Physical and Magical Defense of himself and the teammate with the lowest Health nearby.",
            "type": "passive"
          },
          {
            "name": "Torrential Blade",
            "description": "Damages and slows enemies within range. September 10 update: Skill 1 - Torrential Blade: base damage and weapon flying damage each change from 320 (+64 per skill level) (+110% Physical Attack) → 300 (+60 per skill level) (+100% Physical Attack). Ground damage over time: 75 (+15 per skill level) (+15% Physical Attack) → 50 (+10 per skill level) (+12% Physical Attack).",
            "type": "skill1"
          },
          {
            "name": "Island's Blessing",
            "description": "Dashes in the target direction, dealing damage to enemies in his path and launching them.",
            "type": "skill2"
          },
          {
            "name": "Raging Sea",
            "description": "Splits the earth, damaging enemies within range and launching them. The fractured earth damages and slows enemies.",
            "type": "ultimate"
          }
        ],
        "pick_when": [
          "Your team needs a durable roamer who can protect carries while starting fights with knockup control.",
          "Your allies can follow Island's Blessing and Raging Sea, turning Lapulapu's crowd control into kills or objective pressure.",
          "The match rewards early rotations, lane assistance, and defensive body-blocking around the Farm Laner."
        ],
        "avoid_when": [
          "Your team already lacks damage and needs a carry threat rather than another low-damage tank/support.",
          "The enemy can ignore Lapulapu and dive around him unless your backline stays within peel range.",
          "Your team cannot follow engages, because Lapulapu's control creates windows rather than solo burst kills."
        ],
        "power_spikes": [
          "Early game: public guide data highlights his passive defensive stats and roamer rotations as early strengths.",
          "First coordinated engage: Island's Blessing into Torrential Blade gives knockup, slow, sustain, and armor pressure for allies.",
          "Ultimate available: Raging Sea adds another launch and fractured-ground slow for objective or team-fight disruption."
        ],
        "common_mistakes": [
          "Diving beyond ally range and losing the passive protection value for your lowest-health teammate.",
          "Starting fights without follow-up damage, which wastes Lapulapu's knockup and slow windows.",
          "Playing him like a damage carry instead of a protector who enables teammates through control.",
          "Saving Raging Sea too long during objective fights where its launch and slow can split the enemy formation."
        ],
